OL,3,ATear gas in Paris and Marseille as
OL,4,Aschool protests grow across France
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Sebastien Lecornu
OL,7,Fcondemned the earlier violence and said
OL,8,Fsince the protests had begun 215
OL,9,Fstudents and 85 staff had been hurt as
OL,10,Fwell as 715 police officers.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
