OL,3,AShip sinks and crew missing after Black
OL,4,ASea drone attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FMoscow has not commented on the latest
OL,7,Fincident, a day after it was accused by
OL,8,FUkrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky
OL,9,Fof striking a civilian vessel carrying
OL,10,Fcorn. EU Commission President Ursula
OL,11,Fvon der Leyen said the attacks were
OL,12,F"unacceptable".
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
